        "profile_photo_url": "a-/ALV-UjWCcpvORfJaMGzrrlW4Eq0VdHekr8ENHrsSbUO4regUkmuwXUU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I recently visited PC Chandra Jewellers, and I was thoroughly impressed. The sheer variety of their jewelry collection is remarkable, catering to diverse tastes and occasions. From traditional designs to contemporary pieces, they have something for everyone. What truly stood out, however, was the exceptional behavior of the staff. They were incredibly patient, knowledgeable, and attentive, taking the time to understand my needs and offering helpful suggestions without any pressure. Their warm and welcoming demeanor made the entire shopping experience a pleasure. I highly recommend PC Chandra Jewellers for anyone looking for quality jewelry and outstanding customer service.",
        "time": 1740383754
      },
